# vm.args for the ezx release (ERTS flags applied at boot).
# Node name enables the bin/ezx start/stop/ping daemon commands; a desktop
# app runs as a single instance, so the fixed short name is fine.
-sname ezx
# Fixed cookie so the extended start scripts (bin/ezx on Unix, bin\ezx.cmd on
# Windows) work without a ~/.erlang.cookie; single-instance desktop app.
-setcookie ezx_spectrum_emulator
# Kernel poll gives the emulator steady timer delivery for audio/timing.
+K true
